      "writtenOn": "2018-01-26T23:35:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When I was reading the earlier gerrits in this series, I was expecting this gerrit to do something very different that what it\u0027s doing here. If an acct_update_power() doesn\u0027t account for all the CPU freq transitions between calls to acct_update_power() I don\u0027t see any reason for maintaining per-freq time in state stats for each CPU in this file.",
