      "writtenOn": "2018-01-26T23:35:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks to me like you are completely ignoring any cpufreq transitions between calls to acct_update_power() and assuming the entire time between those calls was spent at a particular frequency. I\u0027m making this assumption because it doesn\u0027t look like this function is called when the CPU frequency transitions.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 157,
        "startChar": 53,
        "endLine": 157,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "85cf1a1839dc986adbd23cf8eba4fae682d96726",
